\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.7}{\ignorespaces Active role-play workspace, combining the conversation transcript and message composer with scenario progress, session controls, and optional voice and affect-aware functions. The standard affect panel shown here is the lexical estimate; a trained voice--text result, when available, appears in a separate panel.}}{72}{figure.4.7}%
